{"lines":[{"c":1,"h":0.017283117638149492,"t":"Reading","x":0.87177920020188371,"y":0.041253191929644828,"w":0.087653834025065103},{"y":0.081299268835570149,"x":0.05756606781961144,"w":0.90557596842447907,"h":0.046974943724367391,"c":1,"t":"'This Marvellous Invention'"},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"C","x":0.059793814647768333,"y":0.54215116263214325,"w":0.016494844754536948,"c":1},{"w":0.82268040974934897,"c":1,"t":"Of all mankind's manifold creations, language must take pride of place. Other inventions -","h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.11134020737243569,"y":0.16852613039461828},{"w":0.82474227905273445,"h":0.017441859892096456,"x":0.10927834486683234,"c":1,"y":0.18604651190676691,"t":"the wheel, agriculture, sliced bread - may have transformed our material existence, but the"},{"t":"advent of language is what made us human. Compared to language, all other inventions pale","y":0.20493247184537322,"h":0.017451249356138177,"x":0.10927834805328662,"c":1,"w":0.83917526245117191},{"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.83298970540364581,"y":0.22372284202797299,"t":"in significance, since everything we have ever achieved depends on language and originates","x":0.10721648738762099},{"t":"from it. Without language, we could never have embarked on our ascent to unparalleled","x":0.10927835041210471,"h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.24273255786379466,"w":0.80000000000000004,"c":1},{"x":0.10910142123605292,"t":"power over all other animals, and even over nature itself.","y":0.25787074042765168,"c":1,"h":0.019816339820955875,"w":0.51778681437174479},{"x":0.10721649725442414,"c":1,"t":"But language is foremost not just because it came first. In its own right it is a tool of","h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.29941860437178347,"w":0.76082473754882807},{"t":"extraordinary sophistication, yet based on an idea of ingenious simplicity: this marvellous","y":0.31826189088266132,"x":0.10927834491105348,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"w":0.82474227905273434},{"x":0.10515464511934113,"y":0.33575581367717011,"h":0.017444421316831216,"t":"invention of composing out of twenty-five or thirty sounds that infinite variety of","c":1,"w":0.74432988484700524},{"c":1,"t":"expressions which, whilst having in themselves no likeness to what is in our mind, allow","y":0.35465116251428452,"w":0.80000000000000004,"x":0.10927835043243608,"h":0.017441861012089666},{"t":"us to disclose to others its whole secret, and to make known to those who cannot penetrate","w":0.82680414835611982,"y":0.37345860239837303,"c":1,"x":0.10927833806872514,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"y":0.39244186018745686,"h":0.017441861012089777,"x":0.10927834414623011,"c":1,"t":"it all that we imagine, and all the various stirrings of our soul' This was how, in 1660,","w":0.77113403320312512},{"t":"the renowned French grammarians of the Port-Royal abbey near Versailles distilled the","x":0.10721648976032667,"y":0.41133294185194424,"c":1,"w":0.79381444295247394,"h":0.017446128186658694},{"t":"essence of language, and no one since has celebrated more eloquently the magnitude of its","y":0.42779103347394631,"c":1,"h":0.020406104786145463,"x":0.10714220901015342,"w":0.82075637817382807},{"t":"achievement. Even so, there is just one flaw in all these hymns of praise, for the homage to","c":1,"w":0.8206185404459635,"h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.44767441832836929,"x":0.10515464717855139},{"h":0.019083969465648831,"c":1,"w":0.81237111409505214,"y":0.46506165553007262,"x":0.10515464262257714,"t":"language's unique accomplishment conceals a simple yet critical incongruity. Language is"},{"y":0.48401162797546338,"w":0.81649480183919265,"c":1,"h":0.01745636940562445,"t":"mankind's greatest invention - except, of course, that it was never invented. This apparent","x":0.10721651552370266},{"w":0.7896907043457031,"x":0.10927835905509804,"y":0.5029069764679307,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"t":"paradox is at the core of our fascination with language, and it holds many of its secrets."},{"c":1,"t":"Language often seems so skillfully drafted that one can hardly imagine it as anything other","y":0.54215116251495743,"w":0.82268040974934897,"h":0.017449541926313983,"x":0.10721649605049673},{"h":0.020270781592628295,"y":0.5571137375761096,"t":"than the perfected handiwork of a master craftsman. How else could this instrument","x":0.10712029938641242,"c":1,"w":0.76924840291341134},{"t":"make so much out of barely three dozen measly morsels of sound? In themselves, these","w":0.7896907043457031,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.57839107463625949,"x":0.10721650336560438},{"y":0.59738372065430978,"w":0.8144329833984375,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"x":0.10721649788754614,"t":"configurations of mouth - p,f,b, v,t,d,k,g,sh,a,e and so on - amount to nothing more than a"},{"w":0.80824742635091151,"h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.10515463688369588,"y":0.61479741607542004,"c":1,"t":"few haphazard spits and splutters, random noises with no meaning, no ability to express,"},{"x":0.10721649790559222,"w":0.8144329833984375,"t":"no power to explain. But run them through the cogs and wheels of the language machine,","h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"y":0.63358778626971524},{"x":0.10515464545318072,"c":1,"t":"let it arrange them in some very special orders, and there is nothing that these meaningless","y":0.65261627879194195,"h":0.017441861012089666,"w":0.82886596679687508},{"y":0.66999412839642869,"h":0.019083969465648831,"c":1,"w":0.83711339314778654,"t":"streams of air cannot do: from sighing the interminable boredom of existence to unravelling","x":0.10721649917372919},{"h":0.016718775401448616,"c":1,"t":"the fundamental order of the universe.","w":0.34883900960286457,"y":0.68827593185490221,"x":0.10912849487114745},{"t":"The most extraordinary thing about language, however, is that one doesn't have to be a","y":0.7281268351249196,"w":0.78762888590494795,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"x":0.10515462910572997},{"x":0.10721648978241281,"w":0.79381444295247394,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"y":0.74709302297934066,"t":"genius to set its wheels in motion. The language machine allows just about everybody -"},{"x":0.10515463172986841,"t":"from pre-modern foragers in the subtropical savannah, to post-modern philosophers in the","h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"y":0.76598837226031091,"w":0.83298970540364581},{"x":0.10721648760262298,"y":0.78332354675365123,"t":"suburban sprawl - to tie these meaningless sounds together into an infinite variety of subtle","w":0.83298970540364592,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"h":0.017441861012089777,"t":"senses, and all apparently without the slightest exertion. Yet it is precisely this deceptive ease","x":0.10515464352477637,"y":0.802325581118984,"w":0.83711339314778654,"c":1},{"t":"which makes language a victim of its own success, since in everyday life its triumphs are","w":0.80000000000000004,"h":0.017464904874755716,"x":0.10721649473793643,"y":0.82119788609396271,"c":1},{"t":"usually taken for granted. The wheels of language run so smoothly that one rarely bothers to","c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.10721649919815074,"y":0.83852025839119693,"w":0.83711339314778654},{"w":0.82886596679687508,"y":0.85755813925893354,"c":1,"t":"stop and think about all the resourcefulness and expertise that must have gone into making","h":0.017441861012089777,"x":0.10515464537027355},{"y":0.87639459772058337,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"it tick. Language conceals art.","c":1,"x":0.10515463617757324,"w":0.27010309855143227},{"x":0.3521918184962084,"c":1,"h":0.022615832576874939,"y":0.9543054561580997,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29146792093912754},{"c":1,"t":"97","w":0.032989689509073883,"y":0.94912790696276916,"x":0.92164948502990529,"h":0.01453488361674482}],"w":2400,"h":3406}